#: ../../language/error_codes/E0085.md:1
msgid "E0085"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0085.md:3
msgid "Warning name: `unlabelled_break_in_labelled_loop`"
msgstr "警告名称：`unlabelled_break_in_labelled_loop`"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0085.md:5
msgid ""
"Using an unlabelled `break` directly inside a labelled loop is "
"deprecated. Once a loop has a label, name it in a `break` that targets "
"the loop, even when the `break` is not nested inside another loop."
msgstr ""
"在带标签循环内部直接使用不带标签的 `break` 已弃用。循环带有标签后，即使 `break` 没有嵌套在其他循环中，指向该循环时也应写明标签。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0085.md:9
msgid "Erroneous example"
msgstr "错误示例"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0085.md:11
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub fn stop_immediately() -> Unit {\n"
"  outer~: for i = 0; i < 3; i = i + 1 {\n"
"    ignore(i)\n"
"    break\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0085.md:15
msgid "Suggestion"
msgstr "修改建议"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0085.md:17
msgid "Name the loop explicitly in the `break`."
msgstr "请在 `break` 中显式指定循环标签。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0085.md:19
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub fn stop_immediately() -> Unit {\n"
"  outer~: for i = 0; i < 3; i = i + 1 {\n"
"    ignore(i)\n"
"    break outer~\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#~ msgid "An unlabelled `break` appears directly inside a labelled loop."
#~ msgstr "带标签的循环内部直接出现了不带标签的 `break`。"
